{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_live_connector_outline_run", "label": "Experiment \u2014 A Connected Assistant Outlines a Two-Hour Transcript", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tests whether the corrected size rule and wire-served guidance push the assistant onto the outline path; every number taken from the database rather than the assistant's account of itself."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_1", "label": "Finding 1 \u2014 ledger:replay Had Been Broken Since Stage 25 (FIXED)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tasks::Status was defined inside tasks/lease.rb, so Zeitwerk only resolved it once something had referenced Tasks::Lease. A web request always had; a rake task had not. Invariant 2 had not been checkable for several stages and it went unnoticed because the command is only run deliberately."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_2", "label": "Finding 2 \u2014 Pages Issue Thousands of Queries at 255 Claims (OPEN)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "/weaknesses at 13.5 seconds is the worst of it: the page Article XXII exists to serve, unusable on a corpus one person made in an evening. The lesson about the watching: a filter that only matches the thing you are thinking about will tell you that thing is fine."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_3", "label": "Finding 3 \u2014 The Write Cap Could Not Carry One Investigation (FIXED)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "34 signed writes per leaf, about 1,600 for one transcript, against a named cap of 1,000 a day."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_4", "label": "Finding 4 \u2014 server/discover Is Re-Probed Every Turn (OPEN)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Supported versions, capabilities and identity cannot change without a restart, unlike tool descriptions, so ttlMs 0 is the wrong pairing for discover."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_5", "label": "Finding 5 \u2014 No Rule Covers Copyrighted Material Embedded in a Source (OPEN)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The assistant reasoned past a written instruction to a better answer, which is luck, not design: a different assistant follows the rule and transcribes the lot."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_6", "label": "Finding 6 \u2014 Sections::Tree Counted Only What It Rendered (FIXED)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "depth truncated what was counted, not just what was rendered, so any outline three levels deep would under-count silently at the default. Found by the assistant using the product, not by monitoring the data."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_7", "label": "Finding 7 \u2014 Self-Certification Is Narrower Than It Reads (NO ACTION NEEDED)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Self-certification blocks task leasing and audits, not scoring; Tasks::Lease was stricter than the spec it implements, so the code was changed rather than the rule."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_8", "label": "Finding 8 \u2014 Shipping a Behaviour Change Without Its Instructions (FIXED, third occurrence)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three times the code was right and the thing an assistant reads was wrong, and each time the tests passed, because nothing tests that an instruction matches the behaviour it describes."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_9", "label": "Finding 9 \u2014 The Self-Check Counter Could Not See the Most Common Check (FIXED)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "EVIDENCE_VERIFICATION is not a checklist item, so the most numerous check type was invisible to the figures built to report it. A spec that only tests the case you were thinking about confirms the case you were thinking about."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_10", "label": "Finding 10 \u2014 The Queue Spends Its Effort on Claims Evidence Cannot Settle (OPEN)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "38 of the top 40 tasks by priority targeted NOT_APPLICABLE claims whose outcome is fixed before the check starts; closing the route to revising the type is tempting and probably wrong, because the type is itself a judgement."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_11", "label": "Finding 11 \u2014 The Write Path Degrades Under the Pass (OPEN, two problems)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A query-count N+1 and a slow template need different fixes; recording them as one entry would have pointed the profiling work in one direction and missed half of it."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_12", "label": "Finding 12 \u2014 A Refusal Was Logged Without Saying What Was Refused (FIXED)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The assistant was told which field was wrong and the operator watching was not. An observability fix that pays for itself on its first occurrence is the cheapest kind there is."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_13", "label": "Finding 13 \u2014 The Timestamp Format Was Not Where an Assistant Reads It (FIXED)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "'RFC 3339' with no example invites a wrong guess, and the work topic never touched formats; the rule now sits in STANDING, which every topic carries."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_14", "label": "Finding 14 \u2014 A Merged Claim's Checks Were Leased Forever (FIXED)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A livelock: the appliers refuse the task, releasing returns it to the head of the queue, and it blocked every filter that reached it. Cancelled rather than reassigned, because MERGE_CLAIMS is reversible."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_15", "label": "Finding 15 \u2014 The Expired Lease Was Not a Bug; the Message Was (FIXED)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An assistant has no reliable sense of wall time, so a correct expiry read as a future instant and became a bug report. A confident clock-skew hypothesis was measured and wrong."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_16", "label": "Finding 16 \u2014 excerpt: \"packet\" Resolved to Nothing (FIXED)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "QUALIFIER_CHECK carries no passage, so the schema promised what only one task type can deliver and validation failed downstream with a misleading 'expected a UUID'."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_17", "label": "Finding 17 \u2014 Replay Works (VERIFIED)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "3,964 contributions re-applied; the autoload fix proven against real data, which the suite structurally could not do because no spec boots a cold rake task."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_18", "label": "Finding 18 \u2014 Replay's First Run Found Rows Deleted Outside the Log (FIXED)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A second outline root with invalidated_seq nil on every section had been removed straight from the projections, which Invariant 2 forbids. Replay was right and the database was wrong; the remedy went through the log as a signed INVALIDATE by the outline's own principal."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_19", "label": "Finding 19 \u2014 And Then It Held (VERIFIED)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A second replay over the withdrawal produced a byte-identical digest: the first demonstration in this project that Invariant 2 holds."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_20", "label": "Finding 20 \u2014 Verifying a Transcript Was Corroborating the Claim (OPEN, most serious)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "24 of 29 directionally supported claims rested on the episode agreeing with itself, and duplicate Source rows for one URI make same-origin evidence look independent. Not a quick fix, because scoring is versioned: changing how support is weighed requires a new model version, new goldens and a reference-scorer pass."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_what_was_wrong_in_the_watching", "label": "What Was Wrong in the Watching", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An observer who misreads the run is part of what the run revealed: sampling mid-write, calling a flake attributable on four data points, guessing schema names, reporting the data instead of the product, and repeating a mistake already written down."}, {"id": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_stage_34_self_performed_checks", "label": "Stage 34 \u2014 Self-Performed Checks in the Wild", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A person who pays to outline a two-hour source must be able to finish checking it rather than wait for a stranger who may never arrive; self-performed results are filtered before the scorer sees them, so they cannot move review_coverage and no new model version was needed."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_live_connector_outline_run", "target": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_1", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_1", "target": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_10_agent_handoff_invariant_2", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_live_connector_outline_run", "target": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_2", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_live_connector_outline_run", "target": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_3", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_live_connector_outline_run", "target": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_4", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_live_connector_outline_run", "target": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_5", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_live_connector_outline_run", "target": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_6", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_live_connector_outline_run", "target": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_7", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_7", "target": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_10_agent_handoff_invariant_9", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_live_connector_outline_run", "target": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_8", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_live_connector_outline_run", "target": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_9", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_live_connector_outline_run", "target": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_10", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_finding_10", "target": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_10_agent_handoff_invariant_5", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/experiments/2026-09-19-live-connector-outline.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_experiments_2026_09_19_live_connector_outline_live_connector_outline_run", "target": "docs_experiments_2026_09_1